(text "CHANNEL 1  /  FIT ONE FIXTURE'S THREE ISOLATION SHUNTS AT A TIME" (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a33a5a43-b54c-4d1f-b34d-8ddd42ce6c2e"))
(text "A / Offset and input currents" (at 25 55 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "22cff3d4-5921-42e0-a320-add7d72955f5"))
(text "B / Dynamic tests and quiescent current" (at 400 55 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d7797de0-dbf0-4cb8-a701-1b5e5462295c"))
(text "C / Null-loop gain and output swing" (at 25 290 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7846b4bc-8121-4f96-aa66-e040bda77f1f"))
(text "D / Output impedance - ALL DNP" (at 400 290 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2655c35e-f93a-4d92-b3b7-f6c1aeefc465"))
(text "Guard the high-impedance A nodes with REF. Switches remain independent." (at 25 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3a4e641c-c52a-4373-a455-390809cb1115"))
(text "BG open: follower; closed: gain about 101. AC option: remove BDIR, fit BAC and BBIAS." (at 400 280 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4401148b-f7db-479d-a220-8bcb81d8ca3f"))
(text "CNULL = 22 pF is a bring-up starting point. Servo feedback passes through the chip.\nDo not add a local feedback resistor around the null amplifier." (at 25 540 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1a9be68-e9a9-4ac9-b30e-35c161b23380"))
(text "Fixture D values remain open; all D parts stay unpopulated.\nGenerator shields return to AGND. Offset applied stimuli relative to REF." (at 400 515 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fc66da7a-8027-4660-b1b9-ebb08816faf9"))
(text "No board placement/routing. Fixture B PD/Iq is an engineering adaptation of Method 4005." (at 25 568 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8c218387-eea7-49d5-bc0f-3c87a9d3da30"))
